// E0320: `m.BadName` is named by the manifest and has no candidate; `BadName` of `other.onsa` has the same name but is
// another flow, not named, and keeps its one candidate (`fixes = 1`). The path decides, not the name (§2.3, §15.3
// `flow` row; S-718).

@export
pub flow BadName(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample { x } //~ E0320
